<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jŏcōsus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		jocus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of jesting, jocose, humorous, droll, facetious</i>
			(class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of persons: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo humanus et jocosus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Maecenas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					Epod. 3, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Musa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 2, 354</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of
			inanim. and abstr. things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 1, 37</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 332</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					6, 692</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">furtum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 10, 7</span></i>
			: Nilus, <i>the sportive Nile</i>, with
			reference to the merry lives of the Egyptians, <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 1,
				2, 80</span></i>.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jŏ-cōsē</span></b> , <i>jestingly, jocosely</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eumque lusi jocose satis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Q. Fr. 2, 12, 2</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dicere aliquid jocosius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 9, 24, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hor. S. 1, 4, 104</span></i>.</div>
